    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Summary",
      "items": [
        "Generated by sdlc from design sources @ cea73d664d7f; drafts are Claude's reading of the artifact, the acceptor decides",
        "One script, eight subcommands: list route refs prompt render add docs check; every one prints a single JSON line",
        "YAML catalogue is the source of truth; markdown is generated; a 13th member is one YAML file plus one refs folder",
        "Brand colours from a local CSS file: Claude asks once at skill start, --palette-css replaces item colours only; backdrop, neutrals, shadows stay"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Concerns",
      "items": [
        "Watermarked source refs are never committed: 11 regenerated clean via render + add before build ships (resolved 2026-09-17, owner: product owner)",
        "Secret lives in ./.env beside output; .gitignore covers it; walk-up discovery removed on purpose",
        "pytest never calls Gemini; live smoke gated by IIG3D_LIVE=1; acceptance pass is 12 manual renders"
      ]
    }
